//     FIRST complete prefix after the 15-token minimum. For runaway repetition
//     cases (example 3), the first completion after token 15 might be the
//     correct JOIN-only form before the repetitive IS NOT NULL loop starts.
//   Phase 4 fallback: CloseSpanWithinBudget for spans still open after 200 tokens.
//
// Budget: 5 (preamble) + 1 (<<) + 200 (3A+3B) + 400 (fallback) = 606 << 900.
// Guidance: Same as attempt 72 (all guidance changes regressed).
// CSD_RATIONALE_END

